  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Trim and halve pea pods lengthways. Peel and thinly slice orange into wedges. Roughly chop walnuts. • Pat dry firm tofu (see ingredients) and slice horizontally to get 1 piece per person. Season with salt and pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83a8f4264524ca978d63b/step-90202900.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. • When the oil is hot, cook tofu, until golden, 2 minutes each side.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83a8f4264524ca978d63b/step-a2a96810.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a medium bowl, combine pea pods, orange, mixed salad leaves and a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83a8f4264524ca978d63b/step-31032220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide tofu steaks and orange pea pod salad between plates. • Sprinkle walnuts and Parmesan cheese over salad to serve. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83a8f4264524ca978d63b/step-c1e82630.jpg"
    }
  ]
